        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Summary"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Bearer-authenticated Run creation fails workspace-context resolution in staging. This blocks API-first automation workflows from starting new Runs with a PAT, while browser/cookie workflows can still create Runs and Bearer can finish existing Runs."
        }
      ]
